<section class="erp-doc-section" id="whats-new"><h2>What's new?</h2><p>After a Betrio update, each user sees a one-time notice with the most important changes in the installed version. Choosing <b>×</b> or <b>Got it</b> stores the version for that user in Nextcloud, so the notice is not shown again for the same version on other devices.</p><p>When a later Betrio version is installed, the new release notice is shown automatically. The complete history remains available under <b>Help → What's new?</b>.</p></section>
